:: Bog Frog Finish
<<effects>>

<<if $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	Despite <<bhis>> power, you manage to defeat the <<beasttype>>. <<bHe>> flees under the sludge.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>

	<<tearful>> you gather yourself.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Bog]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
	<<beastejaculation>>
	Satisfied, the <<beasttype>> moves away from you.
	<br><br>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<clotheson>>
	<<link [[Next|Bog]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>

	<<tearful>> you gather yourself.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Bog]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<</if>>

